{"title":"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Trapezoid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/834829da086ed651644d6091100aba2bc9611eee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD||BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/7/c17586f266d8a614e45964038dbd11de47c7389e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/8/298b55d1b105f19e8ec15cd3cf37c1dedce6ff52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBA = 23^{\\circ}$\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9ca5e8a969703d4b2af0f496dd416ed320f2ade.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BDC = 46^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />.  The ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fc0676c527bea73515b0eeef409cd7154ac3a0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC: AD$\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/e/49e8520691de7e23593f5612af80aaa342b5f158.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9: 5$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />.  What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e58c11b9b80ccae0f60fa77285d28cd0e3435eef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac 79\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac 45\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac {13}{15}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac 89\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac {14}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"379\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Extend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/238f77f5bd36cadced68f029e4554015289e50ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline {AB}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/e/c4e6778bf0a1850f765de0f9458f3cb37a155c2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline {DC}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> to meet at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.  Then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/1/a0170f547f192b5dc52d51ebcf9d047f80424a8c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\angle BED &amp;= 180^{\\circ} - \\angle EDB - \\angle DBE\\\\ &amp;= 180^{\\circ} - 134^{\\circ} -23^{\\circ} = 23^{\\circ}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"275\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/b/16b4072dec30604cbea5998c12fddd9eacfeb564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BDE$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is isosceles with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/e/8cee5a981c016f765420bc29f4b3c86ac9a53468.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE = BD$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />.  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/3/74373ddd84ad3fccb8a7371621568b9bb3a23979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline {AD} \\parallel \\overline {BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />, it follows that the triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/91275aa1f85be8f39ea3ae3cef68f10100fc664b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCE$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/70422100db8de33f8e5e0ab5062c5bb6a5ac969d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADE$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> are similar.  Therefore\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/934256dbe10381b77781fcd59b44f2e9f2b58dd1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac 95 = \\frac {BC}{AD} = \\frac {CD + DE}{DE} = \\frac {CD}{BD} + 1 = CD + 1,\\]\" width=\"358\" height=\"37\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/d/04da009c941d413d2d4c814be25ec449b5e98dd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD = \\boxed{\\frac 45}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"82\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B\">2009 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a hr